+### Geometric Consistency Loss
+Geometric Consistency Loss $L_{gs}$ maximizes similarity between a training viewpoint and a randomly generated virtual viewpoint to address depth ambiguity from monocular video [S5]. It computes the loss by rendering a virtual camera image, extracting features using a pre-trained network (e.g., VGG-16), and sampling feature vectors from intersection areas to compare corresponding points [S5].
